========================================================================
(1) THE POLYGON: chord product = n, and the skip-shells (outside/inside)
========================================================================
  n= 3: prod|1-w^k| = 3.000000  (= n? True)   nearest gap = 1/n = 0.3333
  n= 4: prod|1-w^k| = 4.000000  (= n? True)   nearest gap = 1/n = 0.2500
  n= 5: prod|1-w^k| = 5.000000  (= n? True)   nearest gap = 1/n = 0.2000
  n= 6: prod|1-w^k| = 6.000000  (= n? True)   nearest gap = 1/n = 0.1667
  n= 7: prod|1-w^k| = 7.000000  (= n? True)   nearest gap = 1/n = 0.1429
  n= 8: prod|1-w^k| = 8.000000  (= n? True)   nearest gap = 1/n = 0.1250
  n= 9: prod|1-w^k| = 9.000000  (= n? True)   nearest gap = 1/n = 0.1111
  n=10: prod|1-w^k| = 10.000000  (= n? True)   nearest gap = 1/n = 0.1000

  n=3 shells:
      skip 1:  3 chords, len 1.7321  SIDE (outside)
  n=4 shells:
      skip 1:  4 chords, len 1.4142  SIDE (outside)
      skip 2:  2 chords, len 2.0000  DIAMETER (inside)
  n=5 shells:
      skip 1:  5 chords, len 1.1756  SIDE (outside)
      skip 2:  5 chords, len 1.9021  DIAGONAL (inside)
  n=6 shells:
      skip 1:  6 chords, len 1.0000  SIDE (outside)
      skip 2:  6 chords, len 1.7321  DIAGONAL (inside)
      skip 3:  3 chords, len 2.0000  DIAMETER (inside)
  n=7 shells:
      skip 1:  7 chords, len 0.8678  SIDE (outside)
      skip 2:  7 chords, len 1.5637  DIAGONAL (inside)
      skip 3:  7 chords, len 1.9499  DIAGONAL (inside)
  n=8 shells:
      skip 1:  8 chords, len 0.7654  SIDE (outside)
      skip 2:  8 chords, len 1.4142  DIAGONAL (inside)
      skip 3:  8 chords, len 1.8478  DIAGONAL (inside)
      skip 4:  4 chords, len 2.0000  DIAMETER (inside)

