(2) REGULAR-POLYGON TOURNAMENT: regular?, sides vs diagonals, Gauss sum
========================================================================
  n= 3: regular=True (out-degrees={1}); arcs on sides(skip1)=3, on diagonals(inside)=0
  n= 5: regular=True (out-degrees={2}); arcs on sides(skip1)=5, on diagonals(inside)=5
