  n=11: regular=True (out-degrees={5}); arcs on sides(skip1)=11, on diagonals(inside)=44
  Gauss sum magnitude |sum chi(k) w^k| (inside balance), should be sqrt(p):
      p= 3: |g| = 1.732051  vs sqrt(p) = 1.732051
      p= 5: |g| = 2.236068  vs sqrt(p) = 2.236068
      p= 7: |g| = 2.645751  vs sqrt(p) = 2.645751
      p=11: |g| = 3.316625  vs sqrt(p) = 3.316625
      p=13: |g| = 3.605551  vs sqrt(p) = 3.605551

